@startuml Quest Checkpoint Completion - Sequence Diagram

title Quest Checkpoint Completion Flow

actor User
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Auth Service" as Auth
participant "Quest Service" as Quest
participant "Geospatial Service" as Geo
participant "Gamification Service" as Game
participant "Social Service" as Social
participant "Notification Service" as Notify
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
queue "RabbitMQ" as Queue

== User Arrives at Checkpoint ==

User -> App: Arrive at checkpoint location
App -> App: Get GPS coordinates
App -> Gateway: POST /quest-participations/{id}/checkpoints/{checkpointId}/complete\n{location, photo}
activate Gateway

Gateway -> Auth: Validate JWT token
activate Auth
Auth --> Gateway: User authenticated
deactivate Auth

Gateway -> Quest: Complete checkpoint request
activate Quest

== Validate Location ==

Quest -> Geo: Validate location\n{lat, long, checkpointId}
activate Geo

Geo -> DB: Get checkpoint location
DB --> Geo: Checkpoint coordinates

Geo -> Geo: Calculate distance\nbetween user and checkpoint
alt Distance > 50 meters
    Geo --> Quest: Location invalid (too far)
    Quest --> Gateway: 400 Bad Request:\nToo far from checkpoint
    Gateway --> App: Error: Not at checkpoint
    App --> User: "You're not at the checkpoint location"
else Distance <= 50 meters
    Geo --> Quest: Location valid
    deactivate Geo

    == Save Checkpoint Completion ==

    Quest -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION

    Quest -> DB: INSERT checkpoint_completion\n(participation_id, checkpoint_id, location, photo_url)
    DB --> Quest: Completion saved

    Quest -> DB: UPDATE quest_participation\nSET progress = progress + 1
    DB --> Quest: Participation updated

    Quest -> DB: SELECT * FROM quest_participation\nWHERE id = participation_id
    DB --> Quest: Participation details

    alt All checkpoints completed
        Quest -> DB: UPDATE quest_participation\nSET status = 'COMPLETED',\ncompleted_at = NOW()
        DB --> Quest: Quest marked complete
        Quest -> Quest: Calculate total XP reward
    end

    Quest -> DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION

    == Publish Event ==

    Quest -> Queue: Publish "CheckpointCompleted" event\n{userId, questId, checkpointId, xpEarned}
    activate Queue

    Quest --> Gateway: 200 OK\n{completion, xpEarned, nextCheckpoint}
    deactivate Quest

    Gateway --> App: Checkpoint completed successfully
    deactivate Gateway

    App --> User: "Checkpoint completed!\n+50 XP earned"

    == Asynchronous Event Processing ==

    Queue -> Game: Consume "CheckpointCompleted"
    activate Game

    Game -> DB: UPDATE player_stats\nSET total_xp = total_xp + xp_earned
    DB --> Game: XP updated

    Game -> Game: Check for level up
    alt Level up achieved
        Game -> DB: UPDATE player_stats\nSET level = level + 1
        DB --> Game: Level updated

        Game -> Queue: Publish "LevelUp" event
        Queue --> Game: Event published
    end

    Game -> Game: Check achievements
    alt Achievement unlocked
        Game -> DB: INSERT badge\n(user_id, achievement_id)
        DB --> Game: Badge awarded

        Game -> Queue: Publish "AchievementUnlocked" event
        Queue --> Game: Event published
    end

    deactivate Game

    Queue -> Social: Consume "CheckpointCompleted"
    activate Social

    Social -> DB: INSERT activity_feed_post\n(user_id, type='checkpoint', data)
    DB --> Social: Post created

    Social -> DB: SELECT friends WHERE user_id = userId
    DB --> Social: Friend list

    Social -> Queue: Publish "NewFeedPost" event
    deactivate Social

    Queue -> Notify: Consume "CheckpointCompleted"
    activate Notify

    Notify -> DB: SELECT notification_preferences\nWHERE user_id = userId
    DB --> Notify: User preferences

    alt Push notifications enabled
        Notify -> Notify: Send push notification\n"Checkpoint completed!"
    end

    alt Achievement unlocked
        Notify -> Notify: Send push notification\n"Achievement unlocked!"
    end

    deactivate Notify
    deactivate Queue

    == Real-time Update ==

    App <-- Gateway: WebSocket: XP updated
    App <-- Gateway: WebSocket: Level up (if applicable)
    App <-- Gateway: WebSocket: Achievement unlocked (if applicable)

    App -> User: Show celebration animation
end

@enduml
